The aero-bar accessories of a self-built triathlon bike: the gel clip that
clamps a gel flask to an aero extension, the brake spacer that fills the gap
between a brake and a carbon rim, and the two-bolt saddle bottle holder that
mounts behind the saddle. Copied verbatim from the pinned commit, keeping
upstream's per-part directories. The derailleur, chain catcher, bar-end
shifter, electronic-shifting and aerodrink sources, the images and the README
are not vendored.

